                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a51d478b-a8c1-37a1-ba74-f2135e5b8d5e",
                        "entry_id": "7a1193e2-61dc-3c7d-9b38-5bb777fd6d1a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "lekarz, specjalista andrologii"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0c8cc52-6d2f-4ac1-a305-21b26e7c8b23",
                                "sense_id": "a51d478b-a8c1-37a1-ba74-f2135e5b8d5e",
                                "text": "Jeśli masz jakieś problemy z erekcją, musisz iść z wizytą do androloga, urologa albo seksuologa."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0a7dab9a-5558-4e16-afa7-fa44e9daab25",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a1193e2-61dc-3c7d-9b38-5bb777fd6d1a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a51d478b-a8c1-37a1-ba74-f2135e5b8d5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "andrologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "andrologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ada4b27-6db6-3153-9932-9f6cff530cd6",
                                        "entry_id": "09b8a388-8151-32f4-9b55-c3dfd8c5806c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who studies andrology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4095291f-5937-46a0-90b5-58bd4b6c67d0",
                                                "sense_id": "0ada4b27-6db6-3153-9932-9f6cff530cd6",
                                                "text": "Dr. Schirren: The members of this round table keep on speaking about urologists and gynecologists but you never mention andrologists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76a3c1b0-6cd9-4511-bb68-7fd0776b8b26",
                                                "sense_id": "0ada4b27-6db6-3153-9932-9f6cff530cd6",
                                                "text": "It may not be easy to find an andrologist or get an appointment with one. Women can call a gynecologist for routine check-ups, but it is not the same with andrologists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59095e06-3f7c-40a6-aafe-f025db34329b",
                                                "sense_id": "0ada4b27-6db6-3153-9932-9f6cff530cd6",
                                                "text": "Male infertility specialists are either andrologists (M.D.s or Ph.D. scientists specializing in male fertility and in assisted reproductive technology) or urologists (doctors who specialize in male and female urinary tract problems but are particularly knowledgeable about penis and testicle \"design\"). Many urologists are also andrologists."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4bfcec10-d66f-4412-a6cc-e5f08e67f198",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a1193e2-61dc-3c7d-9b38-5bb777fd6d1a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a51d478b-a8c1-37a1-ba74-f2135e5b8d5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "andrologue",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "andrologue",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17baddff-6fd3-3554-979c-e98f5cf9153c",
                                        "entry_id": "ad770faa-5824-3f0f-94f7-a080ad0eb353",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Médecin spécialiste de la santé masculine, et en particulier des problèmes urologiques et ceux liés à l’appareil reproducteur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b497b80e-d175-40e5-b5c1-84732da8612b",
                                                "sense_id": "17baddff-6fd3-3554-979c-e98f5cf9153c",
                                                "text": "Un andrologue est un médecin qui a pour devise : « Rien de ce qui est spécifiquement masculin ne doit m’être étranger ! »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "64ba989e-8693-49d4-a454-d55fe7adf547",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a1193e2-61dc-3c7d-9b38-5bb777fd6d1a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a51d478b-a8c1-37a1-ba74-f2135e5b8d5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "Androloge",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Androloge",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a54df7d-16ce-39a7-a6dd-6fb5710ef7c5",
                                        "entry_id": "93212be2-976c-371b-80a2-8fadcc32045f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Facharzt für Andrologie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1606c9a-edf1-4d4e-aa6d-936e95c5058f",
                                                "sense_id": "4a54df7d-16ce-39a7-a6dd-6fb5710ef7c5",
                                                "text": "„Andrologen streiten darüber, ob nach der Kastration systemisch Antibiotika verabreicht werden müssen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4798d525-d1c4-49db-8d59-e84c076e0b16",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a1193e2-61dc-3c7d-9b38-5bb777fd6d1a",
                        "source_sense_id": "a51d478b-a8c1-37a1-ba74-f2135e5b8d5e",
                        "target_lang_word": "андролог",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "андролог",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0739678-685d-39a0-8a52-b12484692ab8",
                                        "entry_id": "ee49f44a-45a9-34f2-af17-a707b269a4f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "врач, специалист по андрологии, занимающийся изучением и лечением заболеваний, характерных для организма мужчины"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0c247a0-d1cf-4c54-9e00-2fa0de8efdc4",
                                                "sense_id": "b0739678-685d-39a0-8a52-b12484692ab8",
                                                "text": "Откуда пошло слово «андролог»? «Андрос» — означает «мужчина». Андрей — мужественный. Андролог — это врач для мужчин. Сегодня создаются специальные консультации для мужчин."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
